  ],
  "important_notes": "All four classes are in Composer\\Util namespace. ProcessExecutor and HttpDownloader share the same async job-queue pattern (jobs[], runningJobs, maxJobs, idGen, enableAsync(), wait(), countActiveJobs()). Perforce lazily creates its Filesystem instance. Filesystem delegates OS-level removes to ProcessExecutor (proc_open path) and falls back to pure-PHP iteration. HttpDownloader switches between CurlDownloader and RemoteFilesystem backends based on TLS/availability.",
